flowchart LR
  UE[IMS UE] --> EDGE[Regional P-CSCF]
  EDGE --> SIPLB[Dialog-affine SIP ingress]
  SIPLB --> AS[SIP AS replicas]
  EDGE --> RTP[RTPengine shard pool]
  AS --> STATE[Durable call-state/control service]
  STATE --> VA[Voice Agent workers]
  RTP --> VA
  STATE --> BUS[Metadata queue with TTL]
  BUS --> AI[Autoscaled AI workers]
  KMS[KMS / workload identity] --> AS
  KMS --> STATE
  KMS --> VA
  AUDIT[Redacted audit pipeline] --> SIEM[Restricted security store]
